        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Ma-na-thɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë took Ma-na-thɛ kuäär, tëë kɛ run wäl rɛw, cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ dhieec wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni dueer nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ jiäk dööri tëë joc Kuoth Nhial kɛ raar nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö cuɛ gua̱th pali kuthni guääyni tëë ci gua̱n ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa kɛ da̱k piny nyɔk kɛ lätni, kä cuɛ yi̱kni kuth Baal la̱t bä, kä cuɛ kuth Ä-ce-ra la̱t, kä cuɛ nyin nhial diaal pal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yi̱kni kuthni guäyni la̱t rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar i̱, “Kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, bi ciötdä te thi̱n amäni cäŋ kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nyin nhial diaal ta̱th yi̱kni rɛy käli luaak Kuɔth Nhial da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ gatdɛ thöp ala muc mi waŋkɛ rɛy lo̱o̱lä Ben I-nɔm. Kä tui̱thɛ kä lätdɛ muɔ̱ɔ̱t, kä wëë kä ji̱ wal kɛnɛ ji̱ kuthni. Cuɛ la̱t ni dueer ti ŋuan nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ jɛ jak kä gak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuoth in cɛ la̱t la̱th rɛy luaak Kuɔth, mëë cɛ la̱r Dee-bid kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Thɔ-lo-mon i̱, “Ɛn rɛy luak ɛ mi kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, min ca mɛk rɛy thuk duëli I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, ɣän ba̱a̱ pal thi̱n amäni cäŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi lɛ jak kä jiɛn ɛn muun ɛ mi, mi ca ka̱m guuri mi, mi wa ŋuɔ̱tkä kɛnɛ luëëkä diaal tëë ca la̱r yɛ ɛ ja̱ŋdä ni Muthɛ wä luɔ̱th kä ba kɛ tit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Ma-na-thɛ ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm buath raar, ɛ jɛn ca la̱t ni jiäk ti ŋuan ti la̱nykɛ tëë, ca la̱t ɛ do̱o̱r tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ däk nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riet Ma-na-thɛ kɛ rɔ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ Ma-na-thɛ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ, duundɛ ɣöö /ken kɛ jɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ nöŋ bööth rɛm kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya, tin cua Ma-na-thɛ ben naŋ ala ram mi ca yiɛn, kä cukɛ womdɛ gɔn kɛ gɔɔr, kä cua jɛ pua̱t kɛ ciik yieethä min yian, kä cua jɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ riɛk, cuɛ luny kä Kuoth Nhial, Kuothdɛ, kä cuɛ rɔ jak kä muɔ̱l ɛlɔ̱ŋ nhiam Kuɔth gua̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ Kuoth pal, kä cuɛ palɛ liŋ kɛnɛ riɛkdɛ, kä cuɛ luɔc kuäärädɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cu Ma-na-thɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö Kuoth Nhial ɛ Kuoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ cuɛ päny raar wec Dee-bid, min te kui̱ kony ca̱ŋ, min jay lo̱o̱l rɛy waŋ Gii-ɣɔn, a räth ni Thok Rɛc, a yi̱i̱thɛ rɔ gua̱th ɔ wee kä O-pɛl. Cɛ jɛ la̱t ɛ bär ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kä cuɛ bööth rɛmni la̱th wi̱i̱ni tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuth guäyni kɛ wal woc rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ yi̱kni diaal tëë cɛ la̱t wuɔ̱thni päämni kɛ rɛy luak Kuɔth Nhial kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, yuɔr raar rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yi̱k Kuɔth Nhial nyɔk kɛ ta̱th, kä cuɛ muc malä kɛ muc tɛthkä lɔaac thöp wi̱i̱dɛ. Kä cuɛ ji̱ Juda jiök i̱ palɛ ni Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath ŋot kɛ mi thöpkɛ muckiɛn gua̱thni tin luɔc luɔɔc, duundɛ ɣöö thöpkɛ kɛ Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth kärɔa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Ma-na-thɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Ma-na-thɛ, kɛ palɛ kɛ Kuothdɛ, kɛnɛ riet go̱kä mëë cɛ la̱t jɛ kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial, ni Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ palɛ, kɛnɛ mëë ci Kuoth ɛ liŋ, kɛ dueerkɛ diaal, kɛ thil luthädɛ, kɛ duer mëë lätdɛ ni gua̱th pali kuthni baaŋ, kɛ lätnidɛ kɛ kuth Ä-ce-rim, kɛ kolaaŋ mëë /kenɛ rɔ ni ri̱t, cakɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni göökni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony dhɔrɛ. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Am-on ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Am-on kɛnɛ Lia̱a̱dɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë took Am-on kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ rɛw, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ mëë ca la̱tdɛ gua̱n ni Ma-na-thɛ. Kä cuɛ kuth diaal tëë ci gua̱n kɛ la̱t kä palɛ thöp muc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /kenɛ rɔ ka̱m Kuoth Nhial, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci gua̱n rɔ luär, kä cuɛ gul rep ni dueer ɛ ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jɛ ca̱p mi jiäk, kä cukɛ jɛ näk dhɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
